{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日下午5時45分《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》紅地氈環節於將軍澳電視廣播城正式揭幕，台前幕後傾巢而出慶祝電視台邁向59周年。平日穿梭全港十八區採訪《東張西望》主持團隊暫別密實採訪服，多位新生代小花換上華麗晚裝強勢踏上紅地氈。其中3位焦點女神激罕展現與別不同致命魅力，超大膽性感造型瞬間成為全場傳媒瘋狂捕捉焦點。梁...</p>\n<p>今日下午5時45分《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》紅地氈環節於將軍澳電視廣播城正式揭幕，台前幕後傾巢而出慶祝電視台邁向59周年。平日穿梭全港十八區採訪《東張西望》主持團隊暫別密實採訪服，多位新生代小花換上華麗晚裝強勢踏上紅地氈。其中3位焦點女神激罕展現與別不同致命魅力，超大膽性感造型瞬間成為全場傳媒瘋狂捕捉焦點。</p>\n<h2>梁敏巧鄧凱文台慶紅地氈激罕爭妍鬥麗</h2>\n<p>梁敏巧以充滿健康肉感晚裝造型閃耀登場，並與李芷晴等藝人並肩同行，盡顯美好身段與團隊默契。鄧凱文亦毫不吝嗇豐滿身材，身穿淺色閃亮超低胸吊帶晚裝出戰，頸上配襯一條奪目紅色寶石頸飾，高貴之餘極具視覺衝擊力，讓現場氣氛瞬間沸騰。</p>\n<h2>鍾翠詩</h2>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508454396842383_20789753946afed10075914.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"拼图_美图设计室 (40).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508454396842383_20789753946afed10075914.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>鄧凱文</h2>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508454531671465_11342003686afed101be6e4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"拼图_美图设计室 (39).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508454531671465_11342003686afed101be6e4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>梁敏巧</h2>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508454694916250_9724066836afed1038095f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"拼图_美图设计室 (41).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508454694916250_9724066836afed1038095f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>黎寬怡</h2>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508454828569364_14490511986afed104a1e30.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"拼图_美图设计室 (38).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508454828569364_14490511986afed104a1e30.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>王汛文</h2>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508454952071663_7049201016afed105dff04.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"拼图_美图设计室 (37).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508454952071663_7049201016afed105dff04.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>王嘉慧</h2>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508455054684380_15038248136afed106e31bc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"拼图_美图设计室 (36).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508455054684380_15038248136afed106e31bc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>陳欣庭</h2>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508455184476426_21025953936afed108329ce.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"拼图_美图设计室 (35).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508455184476426_21025953936afed108329ce.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:22.918311+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":796,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T10:35:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:57:20.613611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:48.503417+00:00","content_hash":"fa1b8ee559ca548eb52fad860995d1d3181e912e4188cdca6a9fcd5d2f1ec9e4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}